    "detailed_description": "Embark on an exciting journey with Flynn, a brave bird whose peaceful life is interrupted when his son is captured. Determined to retrieve him, Flynn plunges into a dangerous quest through stunning lands fraught with peril.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956760/extras/355a0f13a5a2eecebfdb400432b2ddac.avif?t=1729859203\" width=265 height=78 /></span><br><br>Fly through lush forests, cities, and dark caverns as you uncover the secrets behind the origin of the bubble threatening your family.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956760/extras/4b60323fc2adacbe18be1b0b7c637c13.poster.avif?t=1729859203\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956760/extras/4b60323fc2adacbe18be1b0b7c637c13.webm?t=1729859203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956760/extras/4b60323fc2adacbe18be1b0b7c637c13.mp4?t=1729859203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956760/extras/6fb6aac80c34816bbc0d43374b589d23.avif?t=1729859203\" width=265 height=78 /></span><br><br>Throughout the journey, Flynn will encounter fascinating characters, each with their own story and role to play in this tale.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956760/extras/591e196ba0e4cd5772a0b42d9bab4394.poster.avif?t=1729859203\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956760/extras/591e196ba0e4cd5772a0b42d9bab4394